00:00:10.009 --> 00:00:11.578
Hi, everybody.

00:00:11.578 --> 00:00:13.747
I want to thank everyone
for tuning in to our show

00:00:13.747 --> 00:00:17.984
and for staying inside
or in their area.

00:00:17.984 --> 00:00:19.485
You're doing the right thing.

00:00:19.485 --> 00:00:22.588
And to all my fellow
New Yorkers, I got to say,

00:00:22.588 --> 00:00:26.125
I'm so proud of you for staying
inside and wearing a mask

00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:27.961
and just doing the right thing.

00:00:27.961 --> 00:00:29.495
A lot of people are watching us.

00:00:29.495 --> 00:00:30.863
A lot of people are
watching New York

00:00:30.863 --> 00:00:34.033
to see what we do, and so
you really are setting the bar,

00:00:34.033 --> 00:00:36.436
so thank you so much for that.

00:00:36.436 --> 00:00:41.474
Yeah. It's Thursday,
so that's closer to Friday.

00:00:41.474 --> 00:00:43.242
Right? It's basically Friday.

00:00:43.242 --> 00:00:47.914
So, let's make some
jokes and comedy.

00:00:47.914 --> 00:00:49.415
-[ Laughs ]

00:00:49.415 --> 00:00:50.450
