00:00:52.819 --> 00:00:54.086
-Come on!

00:00:54.086 --> 00:00:57.290
-Tonight, join Jimmy
and his guests --

00:00:57.290 --> 00:00:59.259
Vince Vaughn,

00:00:59.259 --> 00:01:00.893
Gigi Hadid,

00:01:00.893 --> 00:01:02.895
