00:01:05.598 --> 00:01:07.366
It's "The Tonight Show:
At Home Edition."

00:01:07.366 --> 00:01:09.335
-We in the house, y'all.

00:01:09.335 --> 00:01:12.705
-And now, here's Jimmy.
-Hey, guys.

00:01:12.705 --> 00:01:14.307
Welcome to "Tonight Show:
At Home Edition."

00:01:14.307 --> 00:01:17.510
Well, you guys, today
is National Honesty Day,

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:19.545
which means tomorrow is National

00:01:19.545 --> 00:01:21.180
"Hey, I'm sorry about what I
said yesterday.

00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:23.482
I didn't mean that."

00:01:23.482 --> 00:01:24.517
This is exciting.

00:01:24.517 --> 00:01:25.985
Dr. Fauci said
the U.S. government

00:01:25.985 --> 00:01:29.222
could have a coronavirus vaccine
ready by January.

00:01:29.222 --> 00:01:30.924
So, good news --
we'll be free to go out

00:01:30.924 --> 00:01:33.192
the exact moment
we get snowed in.

00:01:33.192 --> 00:01:34.593
Some business news.

00:01:34.593 --> 00:01:38.665
On Monday, Macy's plans on
reopening 68 of their stores,

00:01:38.665 --> 00:01:40.967
and they're gonna limit how many
customers walk in the same way

00:01:40.967 --> 00:01:43.169
they always have --
by putting a perfume sprayer

00:01:43.169 --> 00:01:45.237
at every entrance.

00:01:45.237 --> 00:01:47.407
"Would you like a --
Would you..."

00:01:47.407 --> 00:01:51.277
[ Wheezes ]

00:01:51.277 --> 00:01:53.079
I saw that Chick-fil-A
is going to start selling

00:01:53.079 --> 00:01:54.848
at-home meal kits.

00:01:54.848 --> 00:01:56.482
Chick-fil-A said,
"The only catch is --

00:01:56.482 --> 00:02:00.986
if you cook it on Sunday,
you're going to hell."

00:02:00.986 --> 00:02:03.856
'Cause they're not open
on Sunday.

00:02:03.856 --> 00:02:04.990
This is fun.

00:02:04.990 --> 00:02:06.860
I read that Haribo gummies
is celebrating

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:08.894
their 100-year anniversary
with a bag

00:02:08.894 --> 00:02:11.664
that includes gummies from
all over the world.

00:02:11.664 --> 00:02:13.465
People say all
the gummies are good,

00:02:13.465 --> 00:02:18.938
but the ones from Amsterdam
are amazing.

00:02:18.938 --> 00:02:20.673
In an Instagram post,
Britney Spears

00:02:20.673 --> 00:02:24.243
said that she accidently
burned down her home gym.

00:02:24.243 --> 00:02:25.844
Yep, she said it
was an accident,

00:02:25.844 --> 00:02:27.247
but people are suspicious,
because today,

00:02:27.247 --> 00:02:28.548
she released her new single,

00:02:28.548 --> 00:02:32.484
"Oops!...I Did It For the
Insurance Money."

00:02:32.484 --> 00:02:33.920
Listen to this.

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:37.956
A city in Sweden dumped over
2,000 pounds of chicken manure

00:02:37.956 --> 00:02:41.427
in its main park to keep
residents from gathering there.

00:02:41.427 --> 00:02:42.728
Meanwhile, locals were like,

00:02:42.728 --> 00:02:46.766
"Or you could have
just put up a sign.

00:02:46.766 --> 00:02:49.902
I guess you went with
the chicken-manure route."

00:02:49.902 --> 00:02:51.604
I read about a guy in Georgia
who is trying

00:02:51.604 --> 00:02:53.606
to set a world record by
having the biggest

00:02:53.606 --> 00:02:56.142
LEGO "Star Wars" collection.

00:02:56.142 --> 00:02:57.911
It was a fun idea until
his family was like,

00:02:57.911 --> 00:02:59.812
"You did what
with our stimulus check?"

00:02:59.812 --> 00:03:01.681
[ Toilet flushes ]

00:03:01.681 --> 00:03:06.552
-[ Laughs ]

00:03:06.552 --> 00:03:07.686
-I mean, that's no sound effect.

00:03:07.686 --> 00:03:09.455
A flushing sound effect
after the joke?

00:03:09.455 --> 00:03:12.859
-[ Laughs ]
-Right after the joke.

00:03:12.859 --> 00:03:17.496
"You did what
with our stimulus check?"

00:03:17.496 --> 00:03:19.532
[ Both laugh ]

00:03:23.569 --> 00:03:25.838
A woman who got a lottery ticket
from her daughter

00:03:25.838 --> 00:03:27.506
as an early Mother's Day gift...

00:03:27.506 --> 00:03:29.642
[ Both laugh ]

00:03:29.642 --> 00:03:32.278
[ Imitates toilet flushing ]

00:03:32.278 --> 00:03:34.380
A woman who got a lottery ticket
from her daughter

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:36.783
as an early Mother's Day gift
won over a million dollars.

00:03:36.783 --> 00:03:38.717
Meanwhile, her son was
standing there with a card

00:03:38.717 --> 00:03:42.421
and a painted rock like,
"You gotta be kidding me."

00:03:42.421 --> 00:03:44.390
That was my gift
to my mom always --

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:48.694
a painted rock...with crayon.

00:03:48.694 --> 00:03:52.197
And it was a good gift.

00:03:52.197 --> 00:03:55.201
No one else
was giving out those rocks.

00:03:55.201 --> 00:03:56.969
And she saved them.

00:03:56.969 --> 00:04:02.775
There was, like, a drawer full
of rocks with crayons on them.

00:04:02.775 --> 00:04:05.478
Finally, I saw that
the FDA told manufacturers

00:04:05.478 --> 00:04:07.714
to make sure its
hand sanitizer taste worse

00:04:07.714 --> 00:04:10.449
so people don't
accidently drink it.

00:04:10.449 --> 00:04:12.719
Well, it seems like
manufacturers are stepping up.

00:04:12.719 --> 00:04:14.753
I think it might really help
people stay safe.

00:04:14.753 --> 00:04:17.089
Check out this commercial
I just saw.

00:04:17.089 --> 00:04:19.392
-Here at Purell,
we know that it's important

00:04:19.392 --> 00:04:21.561
